  "notable_quotes": [
    "Water forms quasi-1D hydrogen-bonded wires in CALF-20 rather than clusters, and the enthalpy increase with loading is driven by water-water interactions.",
    "CO2 and H2O diffusion coefficients are of similar magnitude and both show unconventional non-linear dependence on loading in CALF-20.",
    "CO2 molecules initially adsorb near the center of CALF-20 cages, and at P/P0 ≈ 3×10^-3 nearly every cage contains one CO2 molecule."
  ],
